      "html": "<p>One restaurant does dozens of food safety checks a day. Fridges, deliveries, cooking, cleaning, allergens, opening and closing. Across a group, the paperwork is the job nobody wants. A good food safety audit app gets the check recorded while the person is still doing it.</p>"
