      "html": "<ul><li>UK food businesses need a food safety system based on HACCP. The law is Regulation (EC) 852/2004 and the Food Safety Act 1990.</li><li>Safer Food Better Business (SFBB) is the Food Standards Agency's ready-made system for small caterers.</li><li>An Environmental Health Officer expects daily records: temperature, cleaning, allergens, opening and closing.</li><li>Records are your due-diligence defence. They also drive the confidence-in-management part of the Food Hygiene Rating.</li><li>£75 a month for each phone number that did a check. Everyone else is free.</li><li>The app does not make the kitchen safe. Without the records, you have no defence.</li></ul>"
